1
00:00:54,020 --> 00:00:56,900
=Episode 1=

2
00:00:57,060 --> 00:00:59,300
(Hanguang Gate)

3
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:13,870
Stop!

4
00:01:31,580 --> 00:01:34,180
(Seventh Prince of Great Yue,
Zhao Boqing)

5
00:01:34,640 --> 00:01:35,710
Zhao Boqing.

6
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:37,840
You killed your father and brothers,

7
00:01:38,230 --> 00:01:39,310
seized the throne by force,

8
00:01:39,350 --> 00:01:41,280
and a cold-blooded, brutal man like you

9
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:42,590
will never have Heaven's blessing.

10
00:01:42,870 --> 00:01:43,280
You

11
00:01:43,590 --> 00:01:46,000
are unworthy to rule Great Yue!

12
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:47,310
The dead

13
00:01:48,150 --> 00:01:50,040
don't get to decide who rules.

14
00:01:50,510 --> 00:01:51,200
Heaven's will

15
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:52,840
lies with me.

16
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:54,760
Kill them!

17
00:02:01,710 --> 00:02:02,280
Hyah!

18
00:02:04,120 --> 00:02:04,600
Hyah!

19
00:02:04,600 --> 00:02:05,970
(Princess's Study Companion,
He Xiaoyuan)

20
00:02:10,030 --> 00:02:10,590
Hyah!

21
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:13,560
Someone's rescuing the Crown Prince!

22
00:02:14,190 --> 00:02:14,750
After them!

23
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:16,120
Hurry!

24
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:16,520
Hyah!

25
00:02:24,870 --> 00:02:26,870
He Xiaoyuan.

26
00:02:27,310 --> 00:02:28,280
You again!

27
00:02:29,150 --> 00:02:29,470
Hyah!

28
00:02:31,310 --> 00:02:31,910
Tingting.

29
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:33,700
(Crown Prince, Zhao Junyao)
Where's my Tingting?

30
00:02:33,710 --> 00:02:34,400
He Xiaoyuan.

31
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:36,030
Where's my Tingting?

32
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:36,870
Your Highness,

33
00:02:36,870 --> 00:02:37,750
Mu Tingting is dead.

34
00:02:37,750 --> 00:02:38,630
Just hold on a little longer.

35
00:02:38,630 --> 00:02:39,630
We're almost at the palace gate.

36
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:40,560
Enough.

37
00:02:40,910 --> 00:02:41,710
He Xiaoyuan.

38
00:02:41,710 --> 00:02:42,430
I don't love you.

39
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:43,750
I'm going to join Tingting.

40
00:02:43,910 --> 00:02:44,190
Whoa!

41
00:02:58,680 --> 00:02:59,630
(Zhao Junyao.)

42
00:03:00,470 --> 00:03:02,360
(I've done everything I could for you.)

43
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:04,520
(But in the end,)

44
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:07,190
(Mu Tingting is still
the only one you see.)

45
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:21,520
Wake up!

46
00:03:23,030 --> 00:03:23,680
He Xiaoyuan.

47
00:03:24,630 --> 00:03:25,680
He Xiaoyuan.

48
00:03:26,190 --> 00:03:27,240
Thirty-three lifetimes.

49
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:28,190
It's been thirty-three lifetimes,

50
00:03:28,190 --> 00:03:29,030
and you still haven't won his heart.

51
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:30,960
Your stupidity is making me sick.

52
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:36,960
How do you know
about the thirty-three lifetimes?

53
00:03:38,750 --> 00:03:40,710
Were you reborn too?

54
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:43,560
What else, you fool?

55
00:03:44,150 --> 00:03:46,080
I've been with you
through all thirty-three lifetimes.

56
00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:47,360
I've been reborn every time.

57
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:51,190
(Sixth Lifetime)
Long live Your Majesty!

58
00:03:51,190 --> 00:03:52,910
- Long live Your Majesty!
- Long live Your Majesty!

59
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:55,520
I know.

60
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:57,150
Careful!

61
00:03:58,380 --> 00:04:00,220
(Sixth Lifetime)

62
00:04:00,220 --> 00:04:03,100
(Seventh Lifetime)

63
00:04:03,100 --> 00:04:05,540
(Eighth Lifetime)

64
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:07,190
He Xiaoyuan.

65
00:04:07,220 --> 00:04:09,380
(Ninth Lifetime)

66
00:04:09,630 --> 00:04:10,430
What...

67
00:04:11,150 --> 00:04:11,960
What about them?

68
00:04:12,190 --> 00:04:13,560
It's just you and me.

69
00:04:14,190 --> 00:04:14,870
Do you understand?

70
00:04:15,150 --> 00:04:16,600
Your fate and mine are bound together.

71
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:17,992
As long as either of us

72
00:04:17,992 --> 00:04:19,070
fails to achieve our goal,

73
00:04:19,360 --> 00:04:20,720
we'll keep reliving our lives

74
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:22,160
from the age of twenty.

75
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:23,950
My goal

76
00:04:23,950 --> 00:04:24,830
is to ascend the throne.

77
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:25,830
Your goal

78
00:04:25,830 --> 00:04:26,870
is to win his love.

79
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,480
I succeed in every lifetime.

80
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:32,240
Every single time

81
00:04:32,240 --> 00:04:33,680
I could take the throne
with my eyes closed.

82
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:34,720
But you?

83
00:04:34,950 --> 00:04:36,190
You've failed thirty-three times.

84
00:04:36,270 --> 00:04:37,680
Are you a pig?

85
00:04:39,390 --> 00:04:41,070
I'm... I'm sorry.

86
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:43,240
Stop doing things
you have to apologize for.

87
00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:45,600
I've figured it out.

88
00:04:46,510 --> 00:04:47,310
You're not allowed to die.

89
00:04:48,830 --> 00:04:49,830
I won't kill him this time.

90
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:51,240
I'll grant you two a marriage.

91
00:04:51,510 --> 00:04:52,830
You must make him fall in love with you.

92
00:04:55,680 --> 00:04:56,630
Tingting and I

93
00:04:56,870 --> 00:04:57,830
would rather die than obey.

94
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:05,920
When you're reborn next time,
come find me at once.

95
00:05:06,070 --> 00:05:07,190
I'll teach you how to win a man's heart.

96
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:09,160
Remember that.

97
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:10,160
Remember it!

98
00:05:13,620 --> 00:05:14,450
=As Promised=

99
00:05:14,450 --> 00:05:17,100
(Adapted from "The Villain's Guide to Love",
a story on Zhihu Yanyan)

100
00:05:31,480 --> 00:05:32,800
Yuanyuan.

101
00:05:35,190 --> 00:05:36,000
Yuanyuan.

102
00:05:36,360 --> 00:05:37,360
Why are you still lying there?

103
00:05:37,360 --> 00:05:38,040
No sleeping.

104
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:43,430
(I'm back again.)

105
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:44,600
(Twenty years old.)

106
00:05:45,510 --> 00:05:46,830
(The year I became
the Princess's study companion.)

107
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:49,830
I poured everything

108
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:52,430
(Princess of Great Yue, Yun Fang)
I've learned into this letter.

109
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:54,120
I have to win Fu Yang's heart.

110
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:58,120
Got it?

111
00:05:58,510 --> 00:05:59,830
I want you to go to Qingyan Palace

112
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:01,430
and deliver a letter for me.

113
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:02,120
Remember,

114
00:06:02,430 --> 00:06:04,160
you must hand it to Fu Yang personally.

115
00:06:04,830 --> 00:06:05,600
Do you understand?

116
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:10,560
Fu Yang will surely be moved
when he reads it.

117
00:06:17,270 --> 00:06:18,270
(I'm He Xiaoyuan.)

118
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:19,680
(My father is a fifth-rank official.)

119
00:06:19,870 --> 00:06:20,800
(I have a secret.)

120
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:22,430
(Whenever I fail
to win the Crown Prince's love,)

121
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:24,160
(I return to the age of twenty.)

122
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:26,920
(Back to those happy days
when Father, Mother, and my sister)

123
00:06:27,190 --> 00:06:28,560
(were all still with me.)

124
00:06:28,830 --> 00:06:29,870
(So I could once again see)

125
00:06:29,870 --> 00:06:31,070
(my family,
who passed away far too soon,)

126
00:06:31,630 --> 00:06:34,120
(I've relived
the same fate thirty-three times.)

127
00:06:34,390 --> 00:06:35,240
(I kept this secret)

128
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:36,800
(for a very long time.)

129
00:06:37,480 --> 00:06:38,600
(Until)

130
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:40,390
(that ruthless killer,)

131
00:06:40,800 --> 00:06:42,750
(the monster who slaughtered everyone
in the palace thirty-three times,)

132
00:06:42,750 --> 00:06:44,270
(the Seventh Prince, Zhao Boqing,)

133
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:45,830
(turned everything upside down.)

134
00:06:46,070 --> 00:06:46,950
When you're reborn next time,

135
00:06:47,160 --> 00:06:48,270
come find me at once.

136
00:06:48,390 --> 00:06:49,680
I'll teach you how to win a man's heart.

137
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:51,360
Remember it well!

138
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:55,270
Our fates are bound together,

139
00:06:55,780 --> 00:06:57,270
and he wants to teach me
how to win the Crown Prince's heart.

140
00:06:58,070 --> 00:06:59,190
How touching.

141
00:07:02,160 --> 00:07:03,160
But the problem is,

142
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:04,240
I actually

143
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:06,390
don't want to pursue
the Crown Prince at all.

144
00:07:26,830 --> 00:07:27,750
Without the letter,

145
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:29,600
I won't have to go to Qingyan Palace.

146
00:07:30,270 --> 00:07:31,560
And I won't have
to see that monster either.

147
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:33,510
He Xiaoyuan,

148
00:07:34,430 --> 00:07:36,160
you're a genius.

149
00:07:36,510 --> 00:07:37,360
Miss Xiaoyuan.

150
00:07:39,950 --> 00:07:40,680
Miss Xiaoyuan.

151
00:07:40,860 --> 00:07:42,380
(Fu Yang, Zhao Boqing's Study Companion)
The Seventh Prince

152
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:44,120
has been waiting for you
for quite some time.

153
00:07:47,700 --> 00:07:49,700
(Qingyan Palace)

154
00:07:51,750 --> 00:07:53,560
I told you to come see me
as soon as you were reborn.

155
00:07:56,430 --> 00:07:57,430
Why didn't you?

156
00:07:57,950 --> 00:07:59,190
I...

157
00:07:59,800 --> 00:08:01,680
I'm afraid I won't
be able to do it well.

158
00:08:02,240 --> 00:08:03,240
Your Highness,

159
00:08:03,510 --> 00:08:06,070
you should find
another person who's been reborn.

160
00:08:06,070 --> 00:08:07,070
I'm too foolish.

161
00:08:07,270 --> 00:08:09,190
I've failed to win him
over for thirty-three lifetimes.

162
00:08:09,720 --> 00:08:10,190
I...

163
00:08:10,430 --> 00:08:12,310
I'll never be able
to win the Crown Prince's heart.

164
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:17,560
If I could replace you,

165
00:08:18,070 --> 00:08:19,070
I would've done it long ago.

166
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:21,560
How absurd.

167
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:23,040
My grand ambitions

168
00:08:23,680 --> 00:08:26,040
depend entirely on a fool like you.

169
00:08:29,720 --> 00:08:30,430
Pick it up.

170
00:08:51,870 --> 00:08:53,150
Timid and meek.

171
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:54,600
You'll never amount to anything.

172
00:08:55,750 --> 00:08:56,550
He Xiaoyuan.

173
00:08:57,510 --> 00:08:58,440
Listen carefully.

174
00:08:58,840 --> 00:09:00,270
That position of Crown Princess

175
00:09:00,960 --> 00:09:03,240
must be yours
even if you're as dumb as a pig.

176
00:09:04,630 --> 00:09:06,630
I... I understand.

177
00:09:13,270 --> 00:09:14,720
You should know very well

178
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:16,270
what the Crown Prince likes.

179
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:17,910
After thirty-three lifetimes,

180
00:09:18,390 --> 00:09:19,600
has it never occurred to you

181
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:22,550
to do something
about that face of yours?

182
00:09:24,510 --> 00:09:25,120
Answer me.

183
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:31,360
My parents said

184
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:34,270
I'm beautiful just the way I am.

185
00:09:40,870 --> 00:09:42,670
Your parents really knew
how to fool a simpleton.

186
00:09:44,030 --> 00:09:44,720
Come with me.

187
00:09:51,060 --> 00:09:53,900
(Mu Tingting, Top Courtesan
of Ruanhong Pavilion)

188
00:10:08,390 --> 00:10:09,000
Your Highness.

189
00:10:09,440 --> 00:10:11,320
Why did you bring me here?

190
00:10:11,750 --> 00:10:13,670
Don't you want
to win Zhao Junyao's heart?

191
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:14,510
In this lifetime,

192
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:16,150
you'll follow her example

193
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:18,960
and become the next Mu Tingting
before she does.

194
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:19,720
Only then

195
00:10:20,510 --> 00:10:21,670
can you make him fall in love with you.

196
00:10:29,310 --> 00:10:30,610
Good.

197
00:10:38,150 --> 00:10:38,910
Hurry up and come here.

198
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:42,750
What are you gawking at?

199
00:10:43,270 --> 00:10:44,720
Come pour the wine.

200
00:10:44,790 --> 00:10:45,750
Practice.

201
00:11:13,510 --> 00:11:14,390
I'm sorry, Your Highness.

202
00:11:14,630 --> 00:11:15,480
I'll wipe it off for you.

203
00:11:20,390 --> 00:11:21,480
I told you to pour the wine.

204
00:11:21,630 --> 00:11:23,080
Who told you to get so fancy with it?

205
00:11:26,150 --> 00:11:28,270
I... I didn't mean to.

206
00:11:33,600 --> 00:11:34,000
Come here.

207
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:49,910
♪My longing has nowhere to rest♪

208
00:11:50,260 --> 00:11:51,950
♪Through the storm, I drift and sway♪

209
00:11:52,580 --> 00:11:55,590
♪You are the prayer I hold in my palm♪

210
00:11:56,100 --> 00:12:00,430
♪In one frozen moment,
my tears come into focus♪

211
00:12:00,430 --> 00:12:03,170
♪My heart has long known♪

212
00:12:03,640 --> 00:12:05,610
♪We made a promise long ago♪

213
00:12:05,940 --> 00:12:07,560
♪To stay together until the end of time♪

214
00:12:08,230 --> 00:12:11,550
♪You are the fate I cannot escape♪

215
00:12:11,860 --> 00:12:14,710
♪How much must I let go♪

216
00:12:15,030 --> 00:12:16,710
♪For one moment♪

217
00:12:16,980 --> 00:12:19,720
♪To hold each other close♪

218
00:12:19,930 --> 00:12:24,250
♪Would that be enough?♪
